<title>THAILAND: Thailand reaffirms policy baht won't be devalued.</title>
<headline>Thailand reaffirms policy baht won't be devalued.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Finance Minister Bodi Chunnananda reaffirmed on Wednesday that it was government policy not to devalue the baht.</p>
<p>&quot;Speculation on baht devaluation has been based on different analyses. The authorities have no plan to devalue the baht as some foreign analysts might have speculated,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
</text>
